sign:90:90:90:90:0:10:Read this, traveler. This place is connected with many years of history, which is beyond your imagination. This old lighthouse was built a long time ago, and I don’t remember in what years! It worked well and illuminated the way for travelers until the war began. But something in the naval forces got angry, and as soon as a warship headed towards the lighthouse, it crashed into a natural hole, but the engines miraculously continued to work, but the ship did not move. Now it serves as a reminder of what war can do to such beautiful seascapes. Over time, the lighthouse fell into disrepair, because there was no one to look after it.:sign3.ogg
